-- Restore the random-enchant pools of item templates whose RandomProperty names an Ascension pool id
-- (12000-12700, 17000-17200) that exists neither in item_enchantment_template nor in ItemRandomProperties.dbc.
-- ObjectMgr::LoadItemTemplates zeroes such ids, so these items dropped without any random bonus.
-- Items sharing one missing id need different pools, so each row gets its stock AzerothCore value instead.
-- Items without a stock or vanilla pool keep the Ascension id. The guard skips rows that no longer carry it.

-- Vanilla items: stock AzerothCore RandomProperty, identical to the vanilla 1.12 (vmangos) pool
